{
  "about": "The memorial dungeon window (issue #275): Alt+B opens it empty. A party leader talks to an NPC (npc/memorial.txt, loaded with @loadnpc) that runs instance_create on Endless Tower. The window shows the name and both countdowns, Destroy asks yes or no, and OK removes it. The NPC is unloaded at both ends.",
